WEBVTT

19:34.590 --> 19:36.300
He is bullshitting.

19:38.427 --> 19:40.971
Be quiet. They're bluffing.

19:56.528 --> 19:57.779
Shut up!

19:57.863 --> 20:00.240
Admitting to trafficking stolen diamonds
will get us arrested anyway!

20:00.324 --> 20:02.993
But it wouldn't be for murder.
This was your idea in the first place!

20:03.076 --> 20:04.161
I'm not going to jail for you!

31:25.508 --> 31:26.467
Pat him down.

31:51.117 --> 31:52.118
Give it to him.
